flowchart TD
  A[10 ms interval callback] --> B[Read computed player and bull positions]
  B --> C[Calculate horizontal and vertical offsets]
  C --> D{Collision thresholds met?}
  D -->|Yes| E[Play game-over audio and update message]
  E --> F[Remove bull animation class]
  D -->|No| G{Obstacle crossing window and guard?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Increment score and re-arm guard]
  H --> I[Increase difficulty by reducing animation duration]
  G -->|No| J[Wait for next interval]
  I --> J
  J --> A
